the scarlet king it says something that  in a multiverse full of terrifying  world-ending monsters like the sealed  king the hanged king a lot of kinks come  to think of it the crimson con himself  overpowers them all but today we want to  pose and hopefully answer an interesting  question how actually powerful is the  scarlet king after all he's apparently  the greatest threat the foundation has  ever faced we'd be fools to not analyze  what we're dealing with as an adversary  here despite his exploits being well  documented there's a lot about the  scarlet king's personal life we still  don't know what is he doing to pass the  time in that multiversal void while  awaiting his minions to open a portal  into our world does he have friends  fulfilling hobbies do you think he  watched squid game like the rest of us  we just don't know because of these gaps  in our knowledge we're taking a pretty  wide definition of power here we're not  only going to analyze the presumed  abilities of the king himself but also  his reputational and institutional power  including the abilities of the allies  and henchmen in his thrall and of course  to keep things balanced we're also going  to take a look at his weaknesses both  potential and confirmed to get a bigger  picture of the net power of the scarlet  king so grab your prophetical davite  tablets and find a grungy occult  warehouse near you we're gonna find out  just how powerful the king of the  darkness below really is first things  first what exactly is the scarlet king  according to the lore given to us by the  dust and blood tablet he's technically  an elder god born into a whole race of  god-like beings in the vast abyss below  the tree of life already before he even  developed his later powers it's clear  that this puts the scarlet king into an  entirely different weight class to any  human beings even anomalously enhanced  ones like abel or dr bright it's very  likely that the scarlet king's very  understanding of the concepts of life  and death differ greatly from what we  mere mortals think about the subject but  the scarlet king isn't your granddad's  elder god he spent the first eons of his  life becoming the greatest warlord that  the multiverse has ever known killing  and consuming his own siblings in order  to amass greater domination over the  darkness below as he slaughtered his way  through the ancient divine hierarchy he  not only expanded his territory he honed  his skills as a combatant even against  elder gods his own size the scarlet king  is an almost unstoppable warrior either  slaughtering his godly foes or scarring  them so bad that they bent the knee to  him and devote the rest of their lives  to service in short even without any of  his allies or anomalous powers he's a  true master when it comes to one-on-one  combat the scarlet king is also the kind  of tyrant who leads from the front  wanting to get even more red on his  iconic crimson armor after all what's  the fun in starting wars with everyone  if you don't get to bask in the glorious  thrill of bloodshed in mass carnage  right the scarlet king is a big believer  in loving what you do point is we're  looking at a warrior king who can  slaughter gods and goddesses with his  bare hands and takes great pleasure in  doing so to him humans are unusually  intelligent ants mocking him with their  love of life peace order and science  well for the most part anyway physically  he's astonishingly powerful but that  still leaves him with certain handicaps  for example his ability to traverse  dimensions is not what he wants it to be  thanks to the tireless work of groups  like the scp foundation every single one  of his attempts to physically enter our  universe has failed however this doesn't  mean that he doesn't have the power to  at least influence our world even if he  hasn't quite gotten the opportunity to  personally slam dunk planet earth into  the sun yet the scarlet king like a lot  of eldritch beings beyond human  comprehension is able to drive human  beings insane with the mere scope of his  abilities having easily broken the mind  of dr montauk when he learned of the  scarlet king's true nature the scarlet  king is also capable of bringing out the  worst in people projecting his boundless  desire for cruelty and malice into those  vulnerable to him as a truly ancient  being he's had eons of experience and  could easily outsmart and destroy the  psyche of any non-anomalous human being  arrogant or foolish enough to try to  face him from his scp-001 file as well  as the classified documents on procedure  110 montauk we also know that the  scarlet king is able to perceive things  in our dimension in a limited fashion  while he isn't truly omniscient outside  his own reality like our traditional  perception of the abrahamic god he can  sense feelings and energies his  favorites being hate cruelty and  violence however this strength can also  be used against him thanks to the  foundation's knowledge of how the  scarlet king's perceptive abilities work  for example they were able to trick the  scarlet king into buying their lie about  procedure 110 montauk simply through a  massive and coordinated information  campaign that convinced a huge number of  people that procedure 110 montauk  actually was a horrifying act of  profound inhumanity and if it worked  once in this fashion it could be used to  shield other things from the scarlet  king's knowledge creating a huge  weakness for this would-be conqueror  however the scarlet king doesn't need to  wage his evil war alone he is after all  the scarlet king an evil monarch whose  reign brings darkness and barbarism and  as such he's indivisible from the forces  who help him carry out his depraved  goals this segues nicely into our next  question about the power level of the  scarlet king what exactly are his  supposed armies who are his boots on the  ground we'll start with the human and  human adjacent probably the most common  of the groups that the foundation are  forced to counter are scarlet king  cultists such as members of groups like  the children of the scarlet king they  may not be the largest group of interest  or the most trained or well-funded but  they have one thing over all the other  gois truly boundless depravity if you  take a look over the full file for  scp-231  not only will you feel like you need a  shower you'll also realize that there  isn't anything these hooded monsters  wouldn't do in service of their dark  master kidnapping and murder are the two  more mild crimes like with most  dangerous cults the scarlet king's  followers are heavily decentralized and  may have nothing that easily pegs them  as his devotees the fact that he has  human eyes and ears hidden everywhere is  an undeniable feather in the king's  bloody crown but these non-anomalous  cultists only amount to a fraction of  the king's earthly forces he's had human  armies and civilizations pledge  allegiance to his cause over the course  of history take for example  scp-3838 the nomads of the 4th  dimensional step these tribes of turkmen  warriors exist in the exact same place  at vastly different points in time  traveling via a mysterious ritual and a  magical yurt at least one of these  tribes worship the scarlet king and have  a vested interest in his rule over all  things but of course no section about  the armies of the scarlet king would be  complete without his biggest fans a  little extinct culture known as the  davites well extinct for now at least  because as cp 140 an incomplete  chronicle always leaves the possibility  of their return as an open question so  who exactly were these ancient  conquerors just in case you've repressed  the memory the davites were an entire  society of hyper-violent monsters that  loved to use imperialism slavery and  subjugation to get whatever they wanted  and killed all who defied them think of  them like the british empire with more  magic and less tea they based their  entire civilizational philosophy on the  teachings and lifestyle of the scarlet  king which is to say absolute primal  brutality rules and he who can stomp on  everyone else is the leader and of  course nobody stomps harder than the  scarlet king if ever scp-140 was exposed  to too much ink or blood the daevites  would wind up ruling the modern world  and in all likelihood they'd do it in  the name of the scarlet king but those  are only his human and human adjacent  servants for starters he's also got a  legion of conquered elder gods who've  pledged fealty to him and are now some  of the most loyal warriors for their  brutal tyrant of a boss however even a  legion of elder gods is nothing compared  to the scarlet king's generals six of  his seven daughters funny even the most  evil nightmare being ever conceived  indulges in a little nepotism here and  there though in his defense it isn't  easy being a single father admittedly  that's only because he crushed their  mother the kind goddess sana to death in  cold blood each one of his daughters  gives him access to new armies and  powers the golden child atvik brings  tactical brilliance and advanced  knowledge of all things warfare with  children who are equally well versed in  the combat arts then there's agor who  makes up for what she lacks in quality  with sheer insane quantity her children  have produced obscenely large armies  that can overwhelm their foes like the  living tides of hatred and murder all of  which are loyal to the scarlet king  himself next adesap a desolate daughter  as mean and hateful as her dear old dad  her armies charge forth declaring  victory in the name of the king they  also have the ability to spread  devastating pestilence with their mere  presence making other armies deathly ill  and probably making  scp-049 feel extremely anxious he's also  got aziev probably his biggest scariest  daughter that appears in the form of a  giant unstoppable beast her armies are  also bestial nightmares and she herself  seems impossible to harm with any mortal  weapon there's atnot the scarlet king's  frailest daughter but a natural when it  comes to all things magic she and her  reality warping children are actually so  powerful that the scarlet king himself  felt a little threatened by them and he  had them all physically disabled now the  scarlet king has unfettered access to  powerful thaumaturgy at his disposal and  then there's atlif his most mysterious  daughter who prides herself on privacy  and is accordingly a master in the art  of stealth with her and her children  having the ability to change their faces  and walk among people unnoticed with  such absurdly huge armies a large number  of emissaries in our world and six  daughters who grant him obscene and  varied powers it's clear that the  scarlet king truly is the most powerful  enemy that the scp foundation has ever  faced however his most major weakness is  his seventh daughter and her offspring  ahabat the child of hope and the only  daughter strong in spirit enough to  fight back against her monstrous father  her children are great heroes and one of  them is believed to be  scp-999 the tickle monster the scarlet  king may have sown the seeds of his own  destruction as is prophesies that if  scp-999 is nurtured and continues to  grow he may one day become strong enough  to defeat the scarlet king's evil with  his sheer force of good with all these  scarlet king's strengths powers allies  and weaknesses i think we can  confidently answer the question how  actually powerful is the scarlet king to  put it simply he's extremely powerful  perhaps more powerful than anything else  out there but he's still not invincible  the next question is whether the  foundation can identify the cracks in  the scarlet king's blood-stained armor  before he enters our world and  annihilates everything we know and love  now go check out children of scp-001 the  scarlet king is scp-999 really his son  and  scp-001 scarlet king dustin blood for  more insider information on the first  word in pure undiluted evil
 

